<view class="page">
  <view class="heading"
    ><view
      ><text class="title">一起，好好吃饭</text
      ><text class="caption"
        >家庭厨房 · {{mode === 'cloud' ? '家庭共享' : '本地模式'}}</text
      ></view
    ><t-icon name="home" size="32" color="#315c45"
  /></view>
  <view class="notice"
    >{{mode === 'cloud' ?
    '菜谱、收藏、菜单、人数和采购勾选与家人共享。每20秒及返回页面时刷新。' :
    '本地功能始终可用。连接家庭前，请先导出备份；不会自动上传或覆盖数据。'}}</view
  >
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="warning">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="warning"
    >上次操作结果未确认。请重试同一请求，避免重复提交。<t-button
      bind:tap="retry"
      disabled="{{busy}}"
      theme="primary"
      >重试上次操作</t-button
    ></view
  >
  <view class="card padded"
    ><text class="section-title">我的本地数据</text
    ><text class="caption">{{localPreview}}</text
    ><t-button bind:tap="backup" variant="outline" block
      >备份与网页迁移</t-button
    ></view
  >
  <view wx:if="{{!connected}}" class="card padded"
    ><text class="section-title">与家人分享餐桌</text
    ><text class="caption">使用微信云函数确认身份，无需填写账号密码。</text
    ><t-button theme="primary" block bind:tap="login" disabled="{{busy}}"
      >微信身份登录</t-button
    ></view
  >
  <view wx:if="{{connected ? mode === 'local' : false}}" class="card padded">
    <text class="section-title">创建或加入</text>
    <t-input
      label="家庭昵称"
      value="{{displayName}}"
      data-field="displayName"
      maxlength="24"
      bind:change="field"
      placeholder="家人看到的名字"
    />
    <t-input
      label="家庭名称"
      value="{{name}}"
      data-field="name"
      maxlength="40"
      bind:change="field"
      placeholder="例如：我们的厨房"
    />
    <t-button
      bind:tap="create"
      theme="primary"
      block
      disabled="{{busy || pending}}"
      >创建新家庭</t-button
    >
    <t-input
      label="邀请码"
      value="{{code}}"
      data-field="code"
      maxlength="12"
      bind:change="field"
      placeholder="输入12位短期邀请码"
    />
    <t-button
      bind:tap="join"
      variant="outline"
      block
      disabled="{{busy || pending}}"
      >用邀请码加入</t-button
    >
    <t-button bind:tap="sync" variant="text" block disabled="{{busy}}"
      >预览已加入的家庭</t-button
    >
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{canActivate ? mode === 'local' : false}}" class="card padded"
    ><text class="section-title">切换前预览</text
    ><text class="caption">{{previewText}}</text
    ><t-button
      bind:tap="activate"
      theme="primary"
      block
      disabled="{{busy || pending}}"
      >确认、备份并切换</t-button
    ></view
  >
  <view wx:if="{{mode === 'cloud'}}">
    <view class="card padded"
      ><text class="section-title">{{familyName}}</text
      ><text class="caption"
        >{{role === 'admin' ? '家庭管理员' : '家庭成员'}} · {{busy ? '正在保存…'
        : '上次同步 ' + lastSync}}</text
      ><view class="actions"
        ><t-button bind:tap="sync" variant="outline" disabled="{{busy}}"
          >立即刷新</t-button
        ><t-button
          bind:tap="local"
          variant="text"
          disabled="{{busy || pending}}"
          >切回本地</t-button
        ></view
      ><t-button
        wx:if="{{canImport}}"
        bind:tap="importLocal"
        theme="primary"
        block
        disabled="{{busy || pending}}"
        >预览并导入本地数据</t-button
      ></view
    >
    <view class="card padded"
      ><text class="section-title">家庭成员 · {{members.length}}人</text
      ><view wx:for="{{members}}" wx:key="uid" class="member"
        ><view class="member-name"
          ><text>{{item.name}}</text
          ><text class="caption"
            >{{item.role === 'admin' ? '管理员' : '成员'}}</text
          ></view
        ><t-button
          wx:if="{{role === 'admin' ? item.role !== 'admin' : false}}"
          size="small"
          variant="text"
          data-uid="{{item.uid}}"
          bind:tap="remove"
          disabled="{{busy || pending}}"
          >移除</t-button
        ></view
      ><t-button
        wx:if="{{role !== 'admin'}}"
        bind:tap="leave"
        variant="outline"
        block
        disabled="{{busy || pending}}"
        >退出家庭</t-button
      ></view
    >
    <view wx:if="{{role === 'admin'}}" class="card padded"
      ><text class="section-title">邀请家人</text
      ><text class="caption"
        >30分钟有效、仅能使用一次，家庭最多20人。仅转发给你信任的家人。</text
      ><t-button
        theme="primary"
        block
        bind:tap="invite"
        disabled="{{busy || pending}}"
        >生成一次性邀请码</t-button
      ><view wx:if="{{inviteCode}}" class="invite"
        ><text class="invite-code" selectable="true">{{inviteCode}}</text
        ><text class="caption">有效期至 {{inviteExpiry}}</text
        ><t-button bind:tap="copyInvite" variant="outline" block
          >复制邀请码</t-button
        ></view
      ><view wx:for="{{invites}}" wx:key="id" class="invite-row"
        ><text class="caption">{{item.status}} · {{item.expiryText}}</text
        ><t-button
          wx:if="{{item.active}}"
          bind:tap="revoke"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          size="small"
          variant="text"
          disabled="{{busy || pending}}"
          >撤销</t-button
        ></view
      ></view
    >
  </view>
  <text class="page-note"
    >网络异常时请先处理未确认请求。切回本地后的更改不会自动上传；已有家庭数据不能用本地快照覆盖。</text
  >
</view>
